Use the boehmgc port (depends_lib port:boehmgc) rather than the bundled
thirdparty/libgc sources or the prebuilt archives in thirdparty/tcc/lib,
which are only shipped for amd64/arm64.

--- vlib/builtin/builtin_d_gcboehm.c.v.original
+++ vlib/builtin/builtin_d_gcboehm.c.v
@@ -65,28 +65,19 @@
